  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400\u00166F (200\u00166C).",
    "Line a baking sheet with parchment paper and arrange the jalape\u00067\u00060s in a single layer.",
    "Roast for 15 minutes or until slightly tender.",
    "Meanwhile, chop the Thai chilies, red onion, cucumber, and tomatoes.",
    "Combine the chopped vegetables, mint leaves, palm sugar, fish sauce, and lime juice in a bowl.",
    "Remove the jalape\u00067\u00060s from the oven and increase the temperature to broil (high).",
    "Broil for 2-3 minutes or until crispy, turning halfway through.",
    "Drizzle the vegetable oil over the crispy jalape\u00067\u00060s and toss to coat.",
    "Serve hot and garnish with additional mint leaves if desired."
